Date: Sun, 22 Feb 2026 13:47:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add GrapheneOS hardening toggles menu

Add a new 'GrapheneOS features' submenu to TrebleApp with toggles
for GrapheneOS security hardening features that may cause vendor
compatibility issues on GSI builds:

- Memory tagging for vendor processes (persist.sys.phh.gos.mte_vendor)
- Hardened thread stacks (persist.sys.phh.gos.stack_hardening)
- Disable JIT compilation (persist.sys.phh.gos.disable_jit)

All toggles default to OFF for maximum compatibility. Each toggle
includes a description of the security benefit and what it may
break. All require a reboot to take effect.
